  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_PrehistoricWorld_header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"549\"></strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">这是<em>Prehistoric World</em>整合包的默认背景资源包。它灵感来源于<em>Unusual Prehistory</em>模组，仅包含该模组中的恐龙及相关元素图片。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">您可以自由地将此资源包集成到您自己的史前主题整合包中，并按需进行修改。只需注意 &mdash; 它需要配合<em>Loading Backgrounds</em>模组才能正常工作。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要模组：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loading-backgrounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loading Backgrounds</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要服务器与好友一同游玩吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在寻找与好友游玩任何模组或整合包的服务器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 将是您的最佳选择！他们提供性价比最高的 Minecraft 服务器，点击<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a></strong>并使用优惠码 \"Lupin\"，即可享受 25% 的折扣。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_banner1.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>它在服务器上能用吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！它能完美运行！请记住，使用模组和好友联机游玩的最佳方式是搭配 BisectHosting，并且通过<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此链接可享受 25% 的折扣</a></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此资源包可以用于整合包吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！前提是仅发布在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上。上传至任何其他平台均属侵犯我们的权益，且完全不被允许。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果您考虑将其加入您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包中，我们将不胜感激。如需进行任何小调整或有疑问，请随时联系我们！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以录制关于此模组的视频并发布在我的频道上吗？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！您完全可以自由地在您的频道中游玩此模组或我们的任意整合包并制作相关视频，事实上，我们会对此感到非常感激！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_PrehistoricWorld_screenshot1.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_PrehistoricWorld_screenshot2.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_PrehistoricWorld_screenshot3.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_PrehistoricWorld_screenshot4.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>",
